# =============================================================================
# Soteria Assurance — Environment Variable Reference (PUBLIC KEYS ONLY)
# =============================================================================
# Copy the relevant block into the app-local env file it belongs to
# (apps/mobile/.env.local, apps/web/.env.local). NEVER commit real values.
#
# SECRETS DO NOT BELONG HERE.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY and SENDGRID_API_KEY are server-only secrets. They must
# never appear in client config, committed .env files, or this example.
#
# The AI co-pilot Edge Functions read ANTHROPIC_API_KEY from the Supabase
# function environment, never from the browser:
#
#   hosted:  supabase secrets set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
#   local:   put it in supabase/functions/.env  (gitignored)
#
# Without it the AI endpoints return a 503 explaining they are not configured;
# every other check (auth, tenant, rate limit) still runs first.
# =============================================================================

# --- Web app (Next.js) — apps/web/.env.local --------------------------------
# Supabase public client configuration.
# --- Supabase ---------------------------------------------------------------
# The anon key is public client configuration, but must still be supplied by
# the Supabase project owner. Do not use a service-role key in the browser.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://wimedmduiwxlcglbpoae.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
